; @@ on an End Macro line is an error (spec ab3-compat/syntax-rules,
; "Line joining with @@"): joined, the next line would be dropped with
; the rest of the End Macro line.  AmiBlitz3 ignores the @@ there
; (docs/ab3/variant.md, Differences)
Macro m
NPrint "m"
End Macro @@
NPrint "after"
!m
NPrint "end"
End
